From: CEB-GNRD maintainers <bmc@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] sensors: gate initial chassis samples and recheck delayed alarms

Apply the existing ten-second Power OK settling gate to initial chassis
state reads as well as signals. Ignore stale initial replies. Revalidate
delayed threshold edges using the latest sample instead of a ramp value.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
